                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a5d765d-9f42-3ad2-a872-3f165de2cea4",
                        "entry_id": "7e70470b-e998-3308-aa29-d2d5bd756e4b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "вызвать раздражение, аллергическую реакцию, путём внедрения в организм вещества, обладающего определёнными свойствами"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8212c75b-09a1-42aa-bdb0-2a008acd6a1b",
                                "sense_id": "4a5d765d-9f42-3ad2-a872-3f165de2cea4",
                                "text": "Карабасу захотелось есть. Он сунул чемодан в угол, а сам шагнул к столу и уселся в кресло. Да как вскочит, да как заорёт: «Оох!» — будто его ужалила змея. Но это была не змея, а простая обеденная вилка с острыми зубьями. Она лежала на кресле, спрятавшись в чехол. Она-то и уколола Карабаса."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5239e8a0-25a6-4486-a069-c116f71201dc",
                        "source_entry_id": "7e70470b-e998-3308-aa29-d2d5bd756e4b",
                        "source_sense_id": "4a5d765d-9f42-3ad2-a872-3f165de2cea4",
                        "target_lang_word": "sting",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sting",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a1983a4-5595-36e9-84ea-4988fbd6d00e",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bump left on the skin after having been stung."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "139f215d-0581-48f0-85b3-100562712d4e",
                                                "sense_id": "7a1983a4-5595-36e9-84ea-4988fbd6d00e",
                                                "text": "Look at this nasty hornet sting: it's turned blue!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26b93ae9-da81-3bad-8a47-59494df713ed",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A puncture made by an insect or arachnid in an attack, usually including the injection of venom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eef3593-c5e0-4c65-bcf7-3946202bf2c3",
                                                "sense_id": "26b93ae9-da81-3bad-8a47-59494df713ed",
                                                "text": "She died from a bee sting."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7415893-472a-33f1-9cb8-0ea702f5a150",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pointed portion of an insect or arachnid used for attack."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a485cf4c-b01b-38e7-a211-602d76ca6a30",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sharp, localized pain primarily on the epidermis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d176fe0-1dae-47e1-8aec-2f78055d3e90",
                                                "sense_id": "a485cf4c-b01b-38e7-a211-602d76ca6a30",
                                                "text": "That plant will give a little sting if you touch it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f97c04e-d938-3a68-845b-8b8f2a4d3586",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sharp-pointed hollow hair seated on a gland which secretes an acrid fluid, as in nettles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31e70d03-2e6e-35f3-98d1-98226b2961f9",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The thrust of a sting into the flesh; the act of stinging; a wound inflicted by stinging."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55752001-8fa1-41e1-8c61-b86939110d58",
                                                "sense_id": "31e70d03-2e6e-35f3-98d1-98226b2961f9",
                                                "text": "the lurking serpent's mortal sting"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e6c5f25-66bd-32a6-9c72-e81d8226cbd0",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A police operation in which the police pretend to engage in criminal activity in order to catch a criminal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "719c1518-0a91-4d92-8bc2-a83b2ad535cf",
                                                "sense_id": "0e6c5f25-66bd-32a6-9c72-e81d8226cbd0",
                                                "text": "The criminal gang was caught after a successful sting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bdc959d-c51c-439f-8da9-7f983de0fecc",
                                                "sense_id": "0e6c5f25-66bd-32a6-9c72-e81d8226cbd0",
                                                "text": "Shepard: I'm taking you in, Jax.\nTurian Bodyguard: It's a sting. Bastard set us up.\nJax: What the hell are you playing at?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "394418c0-c5a6-3e2b-86c9-a8e9c42dbb6b",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short percussive phrase played by a drummer to accent the punchline in a comedy show."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "589f1ed9-3358-3aee-806d-7b513f91ef84",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brief sequence of music used in films, TV, and video games as a form of scenic punctuation or to identify the broadcasting station."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6a94d1a-780c-3438-a1c9-f8f26b316274",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A support for a wind tunnel model which extends parallel to the air flow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd3d80e5-48b7-4800-90cf-b1cf94526270",
                                                "sense_id": "d6a94d1a-780c-3438-a1c9-f8f26b316274",
                                                "text": "The balance is mounted externally on top of the wind tunnel test section. A sting connects the balance to the model."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c808bfb8-fded-35d4-baa0-ec52795a07d9",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The harmful or painful part of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dab537d2-b480-49f5-9461-dd4dde18df7c",
                                                "sense_id": "c808bfb8-fded-35d4-baa0-ec52795a07d9",
                                                "text": "The ſting of death is ſinne, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa711414-70f5-481d-9b83-0712005e7f36",
                                                "sense_id": "c808bfb8-fded-35d4-baa0-ec52795a07d9",
                                                "text": "Just as it appeared Arsenal had taken the sting out of the tie, Johnson produced a moment of outrageous quality, thundering a bullet of a left foot shot out of the blue and into the top left-hand corner of Wojciech Szczesny's net with the Pole grasping at thin air."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "153d235d-bc88-3a85-bdcb-7179ea7d894c",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A goad; incitement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "893ebf78-c60f-4c5d-a21c-8d2704439d85",
                                                "sense_id": "153d235d-bc88-3a85-bdcb-7179ea7d894c",
                                                "text": "O most potential love! vow, bond, nor space, / In thee hath neither sting, knot, nor confine"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf1cb335-2df5-3221-85f1-702e96a3addb",
                                        "entry_id": "5eee680d-0ea0-36d8-af58-500c663706c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The concluding point of an epigram or other sarcastic saying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sting",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3633f7a3-6d8f-392c-b22e-a70ee2fff771",
                                        "entry_id": "0cd2d90a-29ad-3dca-ac02-d12f74e569c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To hurt, usually by introducing poison or a sharp point, or both."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9ffab52-8c3c-37e0-9b56-b2f1a4294ae0",
                                        "entry_id": "0cd2d90a-29ad-3dca-ac02-d12f74e569c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To puncture with the stinger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4cb0283a-068c-4e3c-bbd7-2fba086c2209",
                                                "sense_id": "a9ffab52-8c3c-37e0-9b56-b2f1a4294ae0",
                                                "text": "A mosquito stung me on the arm."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ad147af-5821-352d-86d5-e6a30336a0cf",
                                        "entry_id": "0cd2d90a-29ad-3dca-ac02-d12f74e569c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To hurt, to be in pain (physically or emotionally)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aae77eb7-a663-4798-ab6a-99f3ba93ec48",
                                                "sense_id": "4ad147af-5821-352d-86d5-e6a30336a0cf",
                                                "text": "My eyes are stinging from the chopped onions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e43e7ce1-6f98-4930-bcda-c6d0f07e1b0e",
                                                "sense_id": "4ad147af-5821-352d-86d5-e6a30336a0cf",
                                                "text": "My hand stings after knocking on the door so long."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e42656c8-886d-4499-9804-f83f1817d09e",
                                                "sense_id": "4ad147af-5821-352d-86d5-e6a30336a0cf",
                                                "text": "Still, it stung when a slightly older acquaintance asked me why I couldn't do any better."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a22afa4-0ba1-4af4-b87a-6ee20c3095b2",
                                                "sense_id": "4ad147af-5821-352d-86d5-e6a30336a0cf",
                                                "text": "But Birmingham were clearly stung by some harsh words from manager Alex McLeish at the break and within 15 minutes of the restart the game had an entirely different complexion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8ccfc26-acab-4996-89e4-9ca5108642ba",
                                                "sense_id": "4ad147af-5821-352d-86d5-e6a30336a0cf",
                                                "text": "While the absence of replayable story missions certainly stings for many fans, Halo Infinite’s campaign still has plenty to offer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d419f1d-a8f6-3469-9e2d-0ba38bd8a284",
                                        "entry_id": "0cd2d90a-29ad-3dca-ac02-d12f74e569c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause harm or pain to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1e41cfc-9cfa-4c03-890c-4fc707d19f9f",
                                                "sense_id": "0d419f1d-a8f6-3469-9e2d-0ba38bd8a284",
                                                "text": "I thought I could park in front of the hotel, but they stung me for five pounds!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
